<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal tax revenues up 17.3 pct yr/yr Q1 '97.</title>
<headline>Portugal tax revenues up 17.3 pct yr/yr Q1 '97.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portuguese tax revenues rose 17.3 percent year-on-year to 896.3 billion escudos in the first quarter of 1997, the Finance Ministry said.</p>
<p>It said the increase was 11.5 percent after bringing forward revenues accounted for in December 1995, but relative to January 1996, in order to make the figures fully comparable between first quarter 1996 and first quarter 1997.</p>
